  description: Formed through the binding of Ice-aligned Mana into a physical vessel,
    Frost Golems are manifestations of elemental power given purpose and motion.
    Their artificial cores sustain bodies of enchanted ice. The knowledge required
    to create such beings is possessed by relatively few practitioners of elemental
    magic.
